      "updatedAt": "2026-02-17T14:32:23Z",
      "text": "Bistromath is one of the reasons why I come to foodpanda. But I was really really disappointed with their beef chowmein today. It used to be my favorite. But today it was totally dry not the usual.",
      "isAnonymous": false,
      "reviewerName": "Nazif",
      "reviewerId": "bddww0xx",
      "ratings": [
        {
          "topic": "overall",
          "score": 3
