          "score": 3
        },
        {
          "topic": "rider",
          "score": 5
        }
      ],
      "type": "user",
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "72375ce5-8d98-4bf9-b028-2019834ca879",
          "text": "We duly apologise for disappointing uou, as we use induction cookers due to LPG crisis it resulted in quicker evaporation than usual, we should have been more mindful. Rest assured the issue will be addressed.",
